{"t":"Alter Mann","p":"Alter_Mann","g":"Übersichten","html":"<div><table> <tbody><tr> <td colspan=\"2\"><b>Alter Mann</b> </td> </tr> <tr> <td> <div>Bild</div> </td> <td> <div>Positionen</div> </td> </tr> <tr> <td> <p><img alt=\"Teleporter.png\" height=\"740\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://de-wiki.metin2.gameforge.com/images/8/87/Teleporter.png\" width=\"300\"/> </p> </td> <td><div> <table> <tbody><tr> <td> <img alt=\"Flag yellow.png\" height=\"31\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://de-wiki.metin2.gameforge.com/images/thumb/f/fd/Flag_yellow.png/50px-Flag_yellow.png\" width=\"50\"/> </td> <td> <table> <tbody><tr> <td> <a data-w=\"Joan\">Joan</a>: </td> <td> 908, 82 </td> </tr> <tr> <td> <a data-w=\"Bokjung\">Bokjung</a>: </td> <td> 772, 140 </td> </tr> </tbody></table> </td> </tr> <tr> <td> <img alt=\"Flag blue.png\" height=\"31\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://de-wiki.metin2.gameforge.com/images/thumb/a/a8/Flag_blue.png/50px-Flag_blue.png\" width=\"50\"/> </td> <td> <table> <tbody><tr> <td> <a data-w=\"Pyungmoo\">Pyungmoo</a>: </td> <td> 125, 1118 </td> </tr> <tr> <td> <a data-w=\"Bakra\">Bakra</a>: </td> <td> 136, 899 </td> </tr> </tbody></table> </td> </tr> <tr> <td> <img alt=\"Flag red.png\" height=\"31\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://de-wiki.metin2.gameforge.com/images/thumb/a/a1/Flag_red.png/50px-Flag_red.png\" width=\"50\"/> </td> <td> <table> <tbody><tr> <td> <a data-w=\"Yongan\">Yongan</a>: </td> <td> 76, 601 </td> </tr> <tr> <td> <a data-w=\"Jayang\">Jayang</a>: </td> <td> 100, 150 </td> </tr> </tbody></table> </td> </tr> </tbody></table> </div> <div> <div>Funktion</div> </div> <div> <p>Er kann dich gegen Geld in andere Maps \"teleportieren\": </p> <ul><li>Von <i>Map1</i> ins <a data-w=\"Tal_von_Seungryong\">Tal von Seungryong</a> und auf den <a data-w=\"Berg_Sohan\">Berg Sohan</a>.<br/></li> <li>Von <i>Map2</i> in die <a data-w=\"Yongbi-Wüste\">Yongbi-Wüste</a> und ins <a data-w=\"Doyyumhwaji\">Feuerland</a>.</li> <li>Mit einem <a data-w=\"Drachengottamulett\">Drachengottamulett</a> kann man sich auch zu der <a data-w=\"Grotte_der_Verbannung\">Grotte der Verbannung</a> teleportieren.</li></ul></div> </td> </tr> <tr> <td colspan=\"2\"> <table> <tbody><tr> <td> <div>Quests</div> </td> <td> <div>Sonstige Informationen</div> </td> </tr> <tr> <td> <div> <ul><li>Level 44 <i><a data-w=\"Schatzkarte_des_Bücherwurms\">Schatzkarte des Bücherwurms</a></i></li></ul></div> </td> <td> <div> <ul><li>Er kostet immer 1.000 <a data-w=\"Yang\">Yang</a>, egal welches Level man ist.</li></ul></div> </td> </tr> </tbody></table> </td> </tr> </tbody></table> </div> </div>"}